  "title": "400 Degreez",
  "country": "US",
  "released": "1998-11-03",
  "notes": "Original release day (November 3 1998) USA CD. This Nov 1998 CD alongside its [url=https://www.discogs.com/release/8165904-Juvenile-400-Degreez]cassette equivalent[/url] would later be reissued in 1999 on CD & cassette; it would include the newly recorded tracks Follow Me Now, Ha Remix ft. Hot Boys & Ha Remix ft. Jay-Z; it removed Solja Rag from the tracklist; and it would add (RE-1) to the catalog number. This reissue (alongside the success of Back That Thang Up) would sell more & propel 400 Degreez much higher on the Billboard 200 in early-mid 1999 than when it debuted here in late 1998, eventually certifying the album selling over 4,000,000 units.",
  "released_formatted": "03 Nov 1998",
